msgid "Play %s"
msgstr "Seni %s"

msgid "About"
msgstr "A-dro"

msgid "Connecting..."
msgstr "Ow junya..."

msgid "Main Menu"
msgstr "Pennrol"

msgid "Quit"
msgstr "Kwyta"

msgid "Keyboard Shortcuts"
msgstr "Kesunyansow bysowek"

msgid "General"
msgstr "Ollgemmyn"

msgid "Playback"
msgstr "Senyans"

msgid "Volume"
msgstr "Uhelder son"

msgid "Play or pause"
msgstr "Seni po powes"

msgid "Stop playback"
msgstr "Astel an senyans"

msgid "Copy current track"
msgstr "Kopia an kan a-lemmyn"

msgid "Stations"
msgstr "Gorsavow"

msgid "Play J-POP"
msgstr "Seni J-POP"

msgid "Play K-POP"
msgstr "Seni K-POP"

msgid "Previous station"
msgstr "Gorsav kyns"

msgid "Next station"
msgstr "Gorsav nessa"

msgid "Window"
msgstr "Fenester"

msgid "Open preferences"
msgstr "Ygeri dewisyow"

msgid "Show shortcuts"
msgstr "Diskwedhes kesunyansow"

msgid "Preferences"
msgstr "Dewisyow"

msgid "Startup Defaults"
msgstr "Dewisyow dre dhefowt orth dalleth"

msgid "Experimental Features"
msgstr "Nasyow arbrovel"

msgid "Default station"
msgstr "Gorsav dre dhefowt"

msgid "J-POP"
msgstr "J-POP"

msgid "K-POP"
msgstr "K-POP"

msgid "Autoplay"
msgstr "Seni awtomatek"

msgid "Start playing automatically on launch"
msgstr "Dalleth seni yn awtomatek orth lonchya"

msgid "Enable pause and resume"
msgstr "Gallosegi powes hag astalleth"

msgid "Use pause and resume for the main playback button"
msgstr "Devnydhya powes hag astalleth rag an boton senyans penn"

msgid "Discord Rich Presence"
msgstr "Discord Rich Presence"

msgid "Enable Discord Rich Presence at runtime"
msgstr "Gallosegi Discord Rich Presence hag an app owth oberi"

msgid "It is time to ditch other radios. Stream and metadata provided by LISTEN.moe."
msgstr "Termyn yw dhe janjya radio. Frodh ha metaroadow provys gans LISTEN.moe."

msgid "J-POP and K-POP radio"
msgstr "Radio J-POP ha K-POP"

msgid "Listen to J-POP and K-POP"
msgstr "Goslowgh orth J-POP ha K-POP"

msgid "Pause and resume the live stream"
msgstr "Powes hag astalleth an frodh byw"

msgid "Animated sound bars that react to the music"
msgstr "Barrennow son bewek a worthyp dhe'n ilow"

msgid "Dynamic colors based on the current album or artist cover"
msgstr "Kolorow janjus herwyd golo an albom po imach an artydh a-lemmyn"

msgid "No ads"
msgstr "Heb argemmynnow"

msgid "Initial release."
msgstr "Dyllans kynsa."

msgid "When connected and there is no album or artist image"
msgstr "Pan vo junys ha nag eus imach an albom po an artydh"

msgid "Colored window when connected"
msgstr "Fenester kolor pan vo junys"

msgid "AI translation (GPT-5.2); reviewed by nobody"
msgstr "AI translation (Codex); not human-reviewed"

msgid "This release focuses on visuals and localization."
msgstr "An dyllans ma a fogell war nebesow gwelesek ha leelheans."

msgid "Fine-tuned dark/light mode detection so light colors are no longer mistaken for dark ones."
msgstr "Gwellheans dhe aswon mod tewal/golow rag na vo kolorow golow kemerys rag re dewal."

msgid "Polished translations and improved how they are applied."
msgstr "Treylyansow gwellheys hag aga devnydh gwellheys."

msgid "Removed gaps between sound bars."
msgstr "Esaow ynter an barrennow son dileys."

msgid "Streaming logic now better handles connection issues and stream changes."
msgstr "An frodh a dhyght gwell kudynnow kevrenn ha janjyow frodh."

msgid "Clarified the application description."
msgstr "Deskrifans an app klerheys."

msgid "Translated image captions"
msgstr "Isklerheansow imach treylys"

msgid "Updated screenshots to use a more reasonable window size"
msgstr "Skeusennyow ekran nowedhys gans braster fenester moy gwiw"

msgid "Updated application icon"
msgstr "Arwodh an app nowedhys"

msgid "Display the application icon in media controls."
msgstr "Diskwedhes arwodh an app yn kontrolyow media."

msgid "Optional Discord activity sharing"
msgstr "Kevrenna oberiantiz war Discord dre dhewis"

msgid "Added Discord activity sharing."
msgstr "Kevrenna oberiantiz war Discord keworrys."

msgid "Reconnect to Discord instead of disabling this feature."
msgstr "Junya arta dhe Discord yn le nag gallosegi an nas ma."

msgid "Added flags to control pause behavior, autoplay, or disable Discord integration."
msgstr "Dewisyow keworrys rag kontrolya powes, seni awtomatek po nag gallosegi kesunysans Discord."

msgid "Fixed an issue where paused playback resumed during a network disruption."
msgstr "Kudyn amendys le mayth astalle an senyans powesys dres trogh rosweyth."

msgid "Added preferences and keyboard shortcuts."
msgstr "Dewisyow ha kesunyansow bysowek keworrys."

msgid "Changed pause, resume, and station switching behavior."
msgstr "Oberans powes, astalleth ha janjya gorsav chanjys."

msgid "Added startup options for pause/resume or stop behavior, with play/stop now the default."
msgstr "Dewisyow dalleth keworrys rag powes/astalleth po astel, gans seni/astel dre dhefowt."

msgid "Check for updates"
msgstr "Hwilas nowedhyansow"

msgid "Cancel update"
msgstr "Hedhi an nowedhyans"

msgid "Couldn't check for updates"
msgstr "Ny yllir hwilas nowedhyansow"

msgid "Try again later."
msgstr "Assaya arta diwettha."

msgid "Already up to date"
msgstr "Nowedh seulabrys"

msgid "You have the latest version of Listen Moe."
msgstr "Yma an versyon diwettha a Listen Moe genes."

msgid "The release metadata is missing a valid SHA-256 digest."
msgstr "Nyns eus som gwir SHA-256 yn metaroadow an dyllans."

msgid "Couldn't download the update"
msgstr "Ny yllir iskarga an nowedhyans"

msgid "Update canceled"
msgstr "Nowedhyans hedhys"

msgid "The update was canceled."
msgstr "An nowedhyans re beu hedhys."

msgid "The update check was canceled."
msgstr "An hwilans nowedhyansow re beu hedhys."

msgid "The downloaded installer will not be installed."
msgstr "An ynstallyer iskargys ny vydh ynstallys."

msgid "Installing update"
msgstr "Owth ynstallya an nowedhyans"

msgid "Listen Moe will close."
msgstr "Listen Moe a dhegea."

msgid "Couldn't install the update"
msgstr "Ny yllir ynstallya an nowedhyans"

msgid "Checking for updates"
msgstr "Ow hwilas nowedhyansow"

msgid "Downloading update"
msgstr "Owth iskarga an nowedhyans"

msgid "Update ready"
msgstr "Nowedhyans parys"

msgid "Version"
msgstr "Versyon"

msgid "Downloaded"
msgstr "Iskargys"

msgid "Looking for a newer Windows installer on GitHub Releases."
msgstr "Ow hwilas ynstallyer Windows nowyttha war GitHub Releases."

msgid "A newer Windows release is available."
msgstr "Yma dyllans Windows nowyttha kavadow."

msgid "The installer is ready to run."
msgstr "An ynstallyer yw parys dhe oberi."

msgid "Couldn't start the installer."
msgstr "Ny yllir dalleth an ynstallyer."

msgid "Removed pause/resume from stable builds."
msgstr "Powes/astalleth dileys dhyworth versyonow fast."

msgid "Separate experimental features from stable features."
msgstr "Diberthans nasyow arbrovel ha nasyow fast."

msgid "Volume control added."
msgstr "Kontrol uhelder son keworrys."

msgid "Karaoke"
msgstr "Karaoke"

msgid "Show karaoke"
msgstr "Diskwedhes karaoke"

msgid "Finding lyrics…"
msgstr "Ow hwilas geryow kan…"

msgid "Just a moment"
msgstr "Unn pols"

msgid "No synchronized lyrics"
msgstr "Nyns eus geryow kan kesamserys"

msgid "This song can still be your tiny concert."
msgstr "An kan ma a yll hwath bos dha gonsert byghan."

msgid "Couldn't load lyrics"
msgstr "Ny yllir karga geryow an kan"

msgid "Try again in a moment."
msgstr "Assaya arta a-benn pols."

msgid "Lyrics by LRCLIB"
msgstr "Geryow kan gans LRCLIB"

msgid "Added lyrics."
msgstr "Geryow kan keworrys."

msgid "Added a song progress bar."
msgstr "Barren avonsyans an kan keworrys."

msgid "Long artist and song names scroll smoothly."
msgstr "Henwyn hir artydhyon ha kanow a skrol yn es."

msgid "Hover over the title to see the full text."
msgstr "Gorra an kursor a-ugh an titel rag gweles an tekst leun."

msgid "Scrolling text and background animations respect Reduce Motion."
msgstr "Tekst ow skrol ha beweghyansow kilva a ober herwyd an dewis Lehe Movyans."

msgid "Translate"
msgstr "Treylya"

msgid "Help translate Listen Moe"
msgstr "Gweres dhe dreylya Listen Moe"

msgid "Help improve Listen Moe translations on Weblate."
msgstr "Gweresewgh dhe wellhe treylyans Listen Moe war Weblate."

msgid "Open Weblate"
msgstr "Ygeri Weblate"
